<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78109" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακατα-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw down beside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακάββαλον</span> [
				Ep.
			 for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακατέβαλον] ἄσπετον ὕλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.127
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶμα δέ οἱ πρῶτον παρακάββαλεν</span>
			<i>he put</i> a waistband <i>on</i> him, ib.<i><span class="en">
				683
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make a claim</i> to property <i>together with a deposit</i>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακαταβολή</span>) to be forfeited in
			case of failure, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).357.58
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Stymphalus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Foed.Delph.Pell.</u>
				4
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				7
			</span></i>; esp. at Athens, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδικασία κλήρου</span>,
			of a claimant by descent, will, etc., as against collateral heirs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὑτοσὶ παρακατέβαλε τοῦ κλήρου ὡς
					υἱὸς γνήσιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					44.42
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				43.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτῷ κατὰ δόσιν π.</span>
				ls.<i><span class="en">
				4.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακαταβολὴ καὶ
					παρακαταβάλλειν</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			 of a claimant who enters a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμαρτυρία μὴ ἐπίδικον τὸν κλῆρον εἶναι</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of one who
			claims property as his own which has been confiscated to the state, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ψήφισμα</span>
			<i>annex</i> a decree <i>to their</i> manifesto, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.25.6
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
